      "text": "Équations du second degré"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lang": "fr",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "text": "- Le discriminant $\\Delta=b^2-4ac$ donne le nombre de solutions."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lang": "fr",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "text": "- Si $\\Delta=0$ : $x_0=-\\frac{b}{2a}$."
    },
    {
      "type": "definition",
      "lang": "fr",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "term": "Discriminant",
      "text": "On appelle **discriminant** le nombre $\\Delta=b^2-4ac$."
    },
